                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "15 euros ? Really ? Hollow Knight costs as much and sits in a league of its own.\nI mean, Demon Hunter 3 is not a bad game. But the asking price and the dumb achievements' design (defeating the hidden objects genre purpose by the way) are just wrong.\nThis is a harsh review, but completing the game only to realize I didn't (for some unknown reason) is frustrating. Same for being forced to watch cutscenes without skipping. Plain dumb.",
